{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":56,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["外族人蒙拯救"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华说：",{"text":"“你们要坚持正义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"秉行公义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我的救恩快要来临，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公义快要彰显。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谨守而不亵渎安息日、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不做恶事的人有福了！”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"归信耶和华的外族人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要以为耶和华会把你和祂的子民分开。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"太监也不要说自己只是一棵枯树。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“如果太监遵守我的安息日、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做我喜悦的事、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"持守我的约，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在我的殿中和墙内赐给他们纪念碑和名号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们胜过有儿女的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必赐给他们永远不会被除去的名号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至于那些归信耶和华、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事奉祂、爱祂的名、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做祂仆人的外族人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是谨守而不亵渎安息日、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"持守祂约的人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必领他们到我的圣山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在向我祷告的殿内使他们欢欣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们献在我祭坛上的燔祭和其他祭物必蒙悦纳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我的殿必称为万民祷告的殿。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"招聚以色列流亡者的主耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“除了这些被招聚回来的人以外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我还要招聚其他人。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列昏庸的首领"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"田野和林中的一切走兽啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来吞吃吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的守望者都瞎眼无知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是不会叫的哑巴狗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只喜欢躺下睡觉做梦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些人就像贪吃的狗，不知饱足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像什么都不懂的牧人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人各行其是，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追求自己的利益。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说：“来吧，我去拿酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让我们喝个痛快！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明天会跟今天一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至更丰盛。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/56.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/57.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/55.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}